WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.003
Think back to a time when
a solution completely missed the mark.


00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:06.439
Probably looked good on paper,
but it failed in the real world.


00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.509
That's the danger of traditional problem
solving.


00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:12.212
It assumes we already understand
the problem.


00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:17.050
It prioritizes speed over empathy and
often confuses confidence with clarity.


00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:20.720
The result
rigid plans for dynamic problems.


00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:22.455
Design thinking changes that.


00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:26.393
It challenges assumptions,
slows us down to listen, and ensures


00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:30.497
we build solutions that truly fit
the people and the environments we serve.
